OL,3,ATrump wants to 'destroy' Canada's auto
OL,4,Aindustry, Carney says of latest tariff
OL,5,Athreat
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump is
OL,8,Fthreatening to impose new tariffs on
OL,9,FCanadian vehicles on 1 January
OL,11,FMeanwhile, Canada's prime minister,
OL,12,FMark Carney, says Trump's latest threat
OL,13,Fis "not a surprise" and that US workers
OL,14,Fwill be hurt by any increased duties on
OL,15,Fautos
OL,17,FHe is preparing a response to fresh
OL,18,Ftariffs imposed by the US on Canadian
OL,19,Fgoods this weekend after trade talks
OL,20,Fcollapsed
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
